{"sourceUrl":"https://art.csu.edu.cn/info/1060/5135.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:13.598540+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://art.csu.edu.cn/info/1060/5135.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>根据</span><span>2027年</span><span>推荐优秀应届本科毕业</span><span>生</span><span>免试攻读研究生</span><span><span>（以下简称</span><span>“推免”）</span></span><span>考核录取</span><span>有关工作要求</span><span>，经学院</span><span>研究生</span><span><span>招生工作领导小组研究决定，制订我院</span>202</span><span>7</span><span>年</span><span>推免考核录取工作实施细则</span><span>如下。</span></p>\n<p><span>    一、工作原则</span></p>\n<p><span>坚持</span><span>科</span><span>学、规范、公平、公开的原则</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>严格规范管理，</span><span><span>严守工作纪律，切实做好</span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span>推免招生</span><span><span>各项工作。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>    二、组织管理</span></p>\n<p><span>（一）研究生招生工作领导小组</span></p>\n<p><span>组长：</span><span>石磊、柯朝晖</span></p>\n<p><span>副组长：</span><span>徐鸣</span><span>、</span><span>解明镜</span></p>\n<p><span>成员</span><span>：刘雪梅、陈乐凯、李志榕、郑伯红、朱力、张俊、伍彦谚、蒋烨、罗红胜、</span><span>邹涛、毛寒、</span><span>丁蕾、洪洋（心理专干）</span></p>\n<p><span>      秘书：李琳丰</span><span>、</span><span>张春香</span></p>\n<p><span>（二）研究生招生思想政治表现考核小组</span></p>\n<p><span>组长：</span><span>柯朝晖</span></p>\n<p><span>成员：</span><span>罗明、许砚梅、</span><span>龚倩、</span><span>罗红胜、吴俊霆、邹涛、徐皎</span></p>\n<p><span>（三）</span><span>综合</span><span>考核</span><span>小组</span></p>\n<p><span>学院成立学科专业</span><span>综合</span><span>考核</span><span>小组，具体实施</span><span>申请材料审核及</span><span>学科专业</span><span>考核</span><span>工作。</span></p>\n<p><span>（四）</span><span>研究生招生考核监督小组</span></p>\n<p><span>成员：石磊、柯朝晖、陈乐凯</span></p>\n<p><span>    三、招生专业</span></p>\n<p><span>我院研究生</span><span>招生专业</span><span>包括</span><span>：</span></p>\n<p><span>    （一）学术学位：</span><span>0813</span><span>建筑学、</span><span>1403</span><span>设计学</span></p>\n<p><span>    （二）专业学位：</span><span>0851</span><span>建筑、</span><span>0853</span><span>城乡规划、</span><span>1352</span><span>音乐、</span><span>1357</span><span>设计</span></p>\n<p><span><span>我校推免生预报名信息采集系统中的招生专业仅供参考，具体推免生招生专业以公布的</span>202</span><span>7</span><span><span>年研究生推免招生专业目录为准，最终录取专业以</span><span>“全国推荐免试攻读研究生信息公开管理服务系统”中录取确认为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>申请人仅限申请以上一个专业。</span></p>\n<p><span>    四、申请条件</span></p>\n<p><span>（一）</span><span>遵守中华人民共和国宪法和法律、诚实守信</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>（二）经教育部批准具有推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生资格高校的</span><span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>届优秀本科毕业生，且有望取得所在学校推荐免试资格。</span></p>\n<p><span>（三）学习成绩优异，综合素质高，有志于从事科学研究工作，有较强的研究能力。</span></p>\n<p><span>（四）具有良好的心理素质，身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检标准。</span></p>\n<p><span>申请报名时间和网址：</span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>28</span><span><span>日</span><span>—</span></span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span><span>0</span></span><span>日，</span><span><span>通过</span><span>“中南大学推免生服务系统”进行网上报名。报名网址：</span></span><span>https://yjszsgl.csu.edu.cn/zsgl/tmsgl/default.aspx</span></p>\n<p><span>    五</span><span>、资格审查</span></p>\n<p><span>      完成网上申请的学生于</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日前提交资格审查材料至电子邮</span><span><span>箱</span><span>224061@csu.edu.cn</span></span><span>，邮件主题为</span><span>“</span><span>推免申请</span><span>+</span><span>申请专业</span><span>及方向</span><span>+</span><span>本科学校名称</span><span>+</span><span>姓名</span><span>”</span><span>，所有材料按顺序整理成一份</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件，文件命名为</span><span>“</span><span>推免申请</span><span>+</span><span>申请专业</span><span>及方向</span><span>+</span><span>本科学校名称</span><span>+</span><span>姓名</span><span>”</span><span>。提交资格审查的材料如下：</span></p>\n<p><span>（一）网上报名《申请表》</span><span>一份</span></p>\n<p><span>（二）本人身份证和学生证</span></p>\n<p><span>（三）个人简历（限</span><span>1</span><span>页）</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>四</span><span>）学习成绩单及成绩排名证明（由所在学校或院系教务部门加盖公章）</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>五</span><span>）大学英语四级或六级考试成绩单</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>六</span><span>）学术成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的工作成果）</span></p>\n<p><span>（七）</span><span>获得的各类荣誉、表彰、奖励证书等</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>八</span><span>）本人签名的诚信承诺书（见附件）。申请人必须保证提交的申请信息及全部申请材料的真实性和准确性，若推免过程中存在弄虚作假情况，一经查实，将取消拟录取资格。</span></p>\n<p><span>    六</span><span>、</span><span>材料审核</span></p>\n<p><span>学院成立考生资格审查和报考材料评议小组，</span><span>对申请人提交的材料予以审核、筛选</span><span>。</span><span>材料审核成绩仅用于对考生能否进入考核的资格认定，不计入考核总成绩。</span></p>\n<p><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span><span>3</span></span><span>日</span><span><span>学生可通过报名网站点击</span><span>“申请状态查询”，如状态为“申请信息院系审核合格”即为取得</span></span><span>面试</span><span>考核资格，可参加</span><span>面试</span><span><span>考核；如显示</span><span>“待审核”，则是</span></span><span>未</span><span>取得</span><span>面试</span><span>考核资格</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>获得</span><span>面试</span><span>考核资格学生在</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span><span>4</span></span><span>日</span><span>18点</span><span>前加入建筑与艺术学院考核</span><span>QQ</span><span>群（群号</span><span>1071705927</span><span>），过期视为放弃</span><span>面试</span><span>考核资格。后期</span><span>面试</span><span>考核相关通知信息将在群内发布。</span></p>\n<p><span>七、面试考核</span></p>\n<p><span>我院按照推免考核工作要求组织面试，面试过程全程录音录像。</span></p>\n<p><span>面试</span><span>考核时间：</span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>17</span><span>日</span><span>--</span><span><span>18</span></span><span>日</span></p>\n<p><span>面试</span><span>考核地点：中南大学建筑与艺术学院</span></p>\n<p><span>具体安排：</span></p>\n<p><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>17</span><span><span>日</span> </span><span>9</span><span>:30</span><span>—</span><span>1</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>:</span><span><span>3</span></span><span>0 </span> <span>报到</span><span>（</span><span>心理健康测试、申请材料原件核验、</span><span>考核顺序</span><span>抽签</span><span>）</span></p>\n<p><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>17</span><span><span>日</span> </span><span>14</span><span>:30</span><span>—</span><span>1</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>:30  </span><span>讲座</span></p>\n<p><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>18</span><span><span>日</span> </span><span>8</span><span>:30</span><span>—</span> <span>面试</span><span>考核（具体安排另行通知）</span></p>\n<p><span>考核</span><span>内容</span><span>如下：</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）专业基础测试</span><span>（</span><span>满分为</span><span>100</span><span>分</span><span>）</span></p>\n<p><span>专业基础测试采用综合性、开放性的能力型试题，考生随机抽取</span><span>试题</span><span>；时间充足条件下可对考生随机提问</span><span>。</span><span>建筑类、城乡规划类、设计类考生</span><span><span>需带</span><span>3-5份</span></span><span>作品集</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）综合素质及能力测试</span><span>（</span><span>满分为</span><span>100</span><span>分</span><span>）</span></p>\n<p><span>综合素质及能力测试考试方式由考官随机提问。</span></p>\n<p><span> <span>（</span></span><span>3</span><span>）外语能力测试</span><span>（</span><span>满分为</span><span>100</span><span>分</span><span>）</span></p>\n<p><span> <span>外语测试一般采取听说交流的形式。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>考试总成绩</span>=</span><span><span>专业基础测试成绩</span><span>+</span></span><span>综合素质及能力</span><span>测试</span><span>成绩</span><span>+</span><span>外语水平考核成绩</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>八、</span><span><span>思想政治素质和品德考核</span></span><span>与</span><span><span>心理健康测试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span><span>.</span> <span><span>思想政治素质和品德考核</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>思想政治表现考核小组按照《关于博、硕士研究生指导教师认定和招生录取工作中加强思想政治把关的有关规定（试行）》要求</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>根据考生表现进行打分，考核等级为</span><span>“</span><span>合格</span><span>”</span><span>和</span><span>“</span><span>不合格</span><span>”</span><span>，考核不合格不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2. </span><span><span>心理健康测试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>心理健康测试根据《中南大学硕士研究生复试心理测验工作的说明》组织和实施，考核等级为</span><span>“</span><span>合格</span><span>”</span><span>和</span><span>“</span><span>不合格</span><span>”</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>   九、</span><span>录取</span></p>\n<p><span>申请人取得正式推免资格后在教育部规定时间内登录教育部全国推免服务系统进行报名，并完成填报志愿，我院将根据学院推免录取实际情况发送复试通知，学生接受复试确认、接受待录取确认后，方可正式完成推免录取。推免服务系统开放时间请关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>   十、</span><span>其他</span></p>\n<p><span>本通知内容与教育主管部门</span><span>及学校</span><span>日后下达文件不符的，以教育主管部门</span><span>及学校</span><span>下达的文件为准。</span></p>\n<p><span>学院联系</span><span>电话：</span><span>0731-8883</span><span>010</span><span><span>4</span><span>，联系人：</span></span><span>李老师</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>中南大学</span><span>建筑与艺术</span><span>学院</span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>4</span><span>日</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"df37b9fc21d89bbb4c3cac7760e74cc1b6f7bf2e5fb328f79f32a73e5518b0cc","textLength":2219,"sourceSha256":"b3f9786a310f801a0a0d07a539b051bdfb4a825e90cb5b7a0d0d94031d8b0701","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"考生诚信考核承诺书.docx","url":"https://art.csu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1698020098&wbfileid=18201463"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b28f178bc56a4fa8a512","title":"2026年中南大学建筑与艺术学院2027年推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生考核录取工作通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:13.598540+00:00"}
